Note (1): Object type as follows:
      C = Ordinary cluster
     CN = Cluster in nebula
     CA = Cluster similar to association
    DCN = Decoupled cluster from nebula
      A = Ordinary association
     AN = Association w/nebular traces
     AC = Association similar to cluster
    DAN = Decoupled association from nebula
     NA = Nebula w/embedded association
     NC = Nebula w/probable embedded cluster
     EN = Nebula wo/association/cluster
    SNR = Supernova remnants
    DNC = Decoupled nebula from cluster
    DNA = Decoupled cluster from nebula
     HS = HI shells and supershells

